# Default apps: what a fresh Aurora OS must offer out of the box.
# Columns (|-separated): category | name shown to users | desktop file id | launch-test
# launch-test: "yes" = the boot test starts the app and checks it keeps running.
# The image test checks every entry is installed, visible and executable.

Internet | Web Browser (Firefox)     | firefox-esr.desktop                        | yes
Internet | Mail (Geary)              | org.gnome.Geary.desktop                    | yes
Internet | Torrents (Transmission)   | transmission-gtk.desktop                   | yes
Internet | Remote Desktop (Remmina)  | org.remmina.Remmina.desktop                | yes

Office   | Writer                    | libreoffice-writer.desktop                 | yes
Office   | Calc                      | libreoffice-calc.desktop                   | no
Office   | Impress                   | libreoffice-impress.desktop                | no
Office   | Document Viewer (Papers)  | org.gnome.Papers.desktop                   | yes
Office   | Text Editor               | org.gnome.TextEditor.desktop               | yes
Office   | Document Scanner          | simple-scan.desktop                        | yes

Personal | Calendar                  | org.gnome.Calendar.desktop                 | yes
Personal | Contacts                  | org.gnome.Contacts.desktop                 | yes
Personal | Weather                   | org.gnome.Weather.desktop                  | yes
Personal | Maps                      | org.gnome.Maps.desktop                     | yes
Personal | Clocks                    | org.gnome.clocks.desktop                   | yes
Personal | Calculator                | org.gnome.Calculator.desktop               | yes

Media    | Image Viewer              | org.gnome.Loupe.desktop                    | yes
Media    | Music (Rhythmbox)         | org.gnome.Rhythmbox3.desktop               | yes
Media    | Videos (Celluloid)        | io.github.celluloid_player.Celluloid.desktop | yes
Media    | Camera                    | org.gnome.Snapshot.desktop                 | yes
Media    | Sound Recorder            | org.gnome.SoundRecorder.desktop            | yes

System   | Files                     | org.aurora.Files.desktop                   | yes
System   | Settings                  | org.aurora.Settings.desktop                | yes
System   | Terminal (Ptyxis)         | org.gnome.Ptyxis.desktop                   | yes
System   | App Center                | org.gnome.Software.desktop                 | yes
System   | Dev Hub                   | org.aurora.DevHub.desktop                  | yes
System   | Screenshot                | aurora-screenshot.desktop                  | no
System   | Disks                     | org.gnome.DiskUtility.desktop              | yes
System   | Disk Usage                | org.gnome.baobab.desktop                   | yes
System   | System Monitor            | org.gnome.SystemMonitor.desktop            | yes
System   | Logs                      | org.gnome.Logs.desktop                     | yes
System   | Backups                   | org.gnome.DejaDup.desktop                  | yes
System   | System Snapshots          | timeshift-gtk.desktop                      | no
System   | Passwords and Keys        | org.gnome.seahorse.Application.desktop     | yes
System   | Characters                | org.gnome.Characters.desktop               | yes
System   | Fonts                     | org.gnome.font-viewer.desktop              | yes
System   | Archive Manager           | org.gnome.FileRoller.desktop               | yes
System   | Power Statistics          | org.gnome.PowerStats.desktop               | yes
System   | Firmware                  | org.gnome.Firmware.desktop                 | yes
System   | Printers                  | system-config-printer.desktop              | yes
System   | Bluetooth                 | blueman-manager.desktop                    | yes
System   | Welcome                   | org.aurora.Welcome.desktop                 | yes
System   | Port Monitor (portop)     | portop.desktop                             | yes

Games    | Solitaire                 | sol.desktop                                | yes
Games    | Mines                     | org.gnome.Mines.desktop                    | yes
Games    | Sudoku                    | org.gnome.Sudoku.desktop                   | yes
Games    | Mahjongg                  | org.gnome.Mahjongg.desktop                 | yes
